#: scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0b14bab9ee703ad38646fa37dd1c1dcfe6c685ff32b400d131be1ca05efad19
#. default-sha256: b9f70d60337fff4e33df2990c648ed8f31a1738643aee52baab5a551028e4d26
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14DC029D_6F9B_49C6_ABBB_63AC9DE30A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The White-Haired Girl’s persistent letters did not "
"improve anything—⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫but simply stoked the flames of misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫수도 없이 적힌 편지는 ⟪k:8⟫사태를 호전시키긴커녕 ⟪k:9⟫오해"
"만 조장했습니다……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1fdb3281e6c5fb90ded25cf9ea158a7b3227ca054652d74f08d898fe12850b29
#. default-sha256: fa0532b674e8260d023c6256f4400fab80c0d7b6ede748ff5ca150e089f53c90
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0230BE86_680D_4245_A157_96799FD22D51"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This continued for several months. ⟪k:1⟫Though outside, the sun shone with the gentle warmth "
"of spring, the cold, bitter winds of winter still relentlessly blew between Jacopo and his wife."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그런 나날이 ⟪k:1⟫몇 달이나 지속되었습니다. ⟪k:2⟫그러다 햇살이 화창한 ⟪k:3⟫봄이 찾아왔지만, "
"⟪k:4⟫둘의 관계는 여전히 엄동설한."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77cf7d24621a7f210d08f090dd22e4fb10515445d34bb6ff5fa6a1888ddc77f6
#. default-sha256: 0055d6fee22db5ecd00e4ac5a6670415f1f1c889203c7ed498838df0ccc15723
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D9FE6E02_E421_4202_B548_271051E2306F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not allowed to leave her shed and never receiving a reply to her letters, the White-Haired "
"Girl’s only source of information was Maria."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫외출도 못 하고―― 편지를 써도 감감 무소식.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫소녀가 전해 듣는 현실은 ⟪k:3⟫마리아의 말 "
"뿐."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8910f60656b688e142b6cd9ee2725e36565bafda8378cf07c23ff20ed4d351a
#. default-sha256: a8ee2b07168a9fd7e75455cfd6d5927c43bf2bf1a8153ceb384f304e205633ec
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9295EFCA_DFA1_49EC_BEA6_19A4B3F31568"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Week after week, her circumstances remained the same, but something else was beginning to "
"show signs of change:"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그런 나날이 지속되니 ⟪k:1⟫이변도 생겼습니다."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df7c1a0b140d20c51bea6fb85dc69be08ed3c48dc75530b83e94feb492a1095d
#. default-sha256: b27bc284379e9ea4447ca3c5ff36c94cc3efeba21b0f52fe8cf9da61c803dad7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4A531797_C484_4ED8_99AD_E9EF3E48E268"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her mental state."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫예――, ⟪k:1⟫소녀의 마음에요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ca153d8caf9275e81d88a0b90bf8222fdf64014aa048ce6173e38fe80620ae0
#. default-sha256: 6f8ad5259c285582b7bb569f313b0793d0d5b01d687cbd60075e6998eec83964
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3AFF6045_6BD0_4728_B88A_C236A237AF98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It’s pointless, Madam.⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫You’re only wasting "
"your time at this point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫마님――, ⟪k:9⟫더는 안 되겠어. ⟪k:10⟫이 이상 해도 "
"⟪k:11⟫무의미해."

#: scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6658b154e01cd1b9370b9b36aeb4269d50d018a8042f9308e714d5ab75abd61
#. default-sha256: 001cde0cc6f74cc1e6ef254882e92ce8bb845819c19e4bef88ea90b266a9e52c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_94B1DBAC_9630_4BC1_9E09_AA36E5ED66AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I saw him throw your letter into the fireplace."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫내가 ⟪k:3⟫봤어.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫그 녀석이―― 마님의 편지를 ⟪k:6⟫난로에 버리는 걸……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12281da04580ea13c4c26fab01c9aa0b13d9dde4b729c5d60b5f910f43e40ab3
#. default-sha256: def796da24bad3b698cbc1c5bec59b9f6a80e08baa673129aa1281da41405b5f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7D2C7799_850B_45F7_9E6A_E0B1EB0FCD9F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He’s not going to read anything you write,⟪k:1⟫no matter how much of your soul you pour into "
"it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이젠 ⟪k:1⟫보려고도 안 해.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마님이 아무리 마음을 담아 편지를 써도 소용이 없어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca2ee8b8fa0fcbb40ea7eac7c7823ade2754d8dd31d1054dc392c09a0c4ffd5e
#. default-sha256: e5df329f6c63a9d6b1eea6361a54e4b125f30a444e92c008c706ff0402f92015
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_398852CA_FECB_4B42_9AE6_2A98A8FAF0CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He cares more about money and work than love.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That’s the kind of man he is."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 녀석은 사람을 사랑하기보단 ⟪k:1⟫돈이랑 일에 환장한 거야.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그런 남자라고."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BE94E12_B9CD_4744_B4A9_8539814B0F6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef996cf325c2a274d347b7dbcc6e2a923e003f24d44f557a4799e0c0c0b39582
#. default-sha256: 776c13602f4f81c4dcc39994111bd83b34ce3fdda3efc7a26066ca20cac8a336
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BE94E12_B9CD_4744_B4A9_8539814B0F6E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Just give up and file for divorce already."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그만 포기하고 ⟪k:1⟫이혼해도 되지 않겠어."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A91AFD46_E069_4D31_87C9_0F5F3C8AA71E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdfaebe2104bca5427ef5b8d24bbf2c3359882427a3941db1bfa9c1189386577
#. default-sha256: 7fc8574b771ac2369527d37f03e7d7f233969bce2797c9879648ce99ea82a85a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A91AFD46_E069_4D31_87C9_0F5F3C8AA71E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫................................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……………………………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C7CD7239_02F4_40D9_9FA5_DCA92B72EDF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37b6088b7d0876003de6583aaeef308125ec036ef666f113a5944c29c3c12736
#. default-sha256: 44c48b77c792a222c7a0c5efeacc56b8934833f5321e9db7bcec3791a4eb3815
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C7CD7239_02F4_40D9_9FA5_DCA92B72EDF5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫No..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……아뇨……, ⟪k:2⟫아니에요……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A174DBE2_8F2C_464A_9A01_1E9AEBCE5D74
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d96561b9563153ea7c918d3a5d12add9ccfa3f838836116996d0cc348fc989f3
#. default-sha256: 6651e1b30249ca5e658a16793341b8f32bf0ed67a4bc5ba4a21cb6a25e928834
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A174DBE2_8F2C_464A_9A01_1E9AEBCE5D74"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I will get through to him...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Everything will go back to normal...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have "
"faith."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫언젠가…… 전해질 거라……,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫전부 ⟪k:3⟫원래대로 돌아올 거라…… 믿고 ⟪k:4⟫있어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_434D9104_934D_4D9E_876C_33E647912E0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6cd9f28b93a2bf6e4945fdf6c7e80bbbed052060ea6a9ac68c0f3a0ded1aaca2
#. default-sha256: ecce7e842a4f5b47c494af99177f4a7f2d48dbf84ed6dd1c16e4407dcdfb9135
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_434D9104_934D_4D9E_876C_33E647912E0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All my letters may go up in flames...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but my faith will not be lost with them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫편지가 다 불타더라도…… ⟪k:1⟫제가 그 분을 믿는 마음까진 ⟪k:2⟫사라지지 않아요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B91FF130_107B_4C5D_91A5_56B2E0FC1501
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0791fe2632fb7d6c2119669729725b3f3d0636a7cd58fcdcbc253188767ce3f7
#. default-sha256: 034bbe2cb7978b68afa04dcddf48f7176dad4dc68549047faf2de7da6e5dd0e4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B91FF130_107B_4C5D_91A5_56B2E0FC1501"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As long as I keep writing..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫쓰다 보면 ⟪k:1⟫반드시……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FF9E4CFF_D915_4518_9A03_681D65EB23E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c945d62784fe8ac762dab11f9b5fb5ff26e947e09441f8080b59850a98bf408b
#. default-sha256: 66a68e8579584a8661eea247fc32366713ecd8ac9ee9c6b0cba5395ff9acb58a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FF9E4CFF_D915_4518_9A03_681D65EB23E6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫eventually... ⟪k:1⟫I will get through to him.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So I cannot stop... ⟪k:4⟫I cannot."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫전해질 거예요…… 다 전해질 거예요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그러니 ⟪k:3⟫멈출 수는 없어요……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FC66C310_D0EC_4D7A_B6E2_D7C0006192FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0089703079f8a79af47c1bd09729707821595add40c6c9fa6d0a12b9e0bd1302
#. default-sha256: e83ef80c8fc3525049fbdce89af286ce10b83d13b8e7dce905ea3896ae65523c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FC66C310_D0EC_4D7A_B6E2_D7C0006192FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you have any idea what he says about you, Madam?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……그 녀석이 ⟪k:2⟫마님을…… 뭐라 부르는지 ⟪k:3⟫알아?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F01194CA_4BA1_4927_8D9B_8AFBA294025E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68bbd3a73895d5396ffc34e07870160e3fe8e6ee530eceeb7df86bcf60246450
#. default-sha256: 2bf0ea6aa3c4527027e168a28f339cf100e6c24c254ac3e7f2d794d415bcecc6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F01194CA_4BA1_4927_8D9B_8AFBA294025E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_1546908A_4815_49FB_8144_C6A5F7BDE298
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86522b6ffd355645551f527e7a60534dd26c0cef736f8efd235330050002a268
#. default-sha256: 868642b9a570dbc84fda780b763637c4391c9628be15166c8b91b8d960224477
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1546908A_4815_49FB_8144_C6A5F7BDE298"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Jacopo doesn’t trust you in the ⟪k:2⟫slightest⟪k:3⟫.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫He goes around calling "
"you a witch.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫A man-eating devil-woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫의심으로 똘똘 뭉쳤더라. ⟪k:2⟫마님을 두고 ⟪k:3⟫마녀라고 했어.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫남자를 홀리는 악마"
"래……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3B0F9553_40AB_4C08_9C9A_29FEF480ED2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67351165d3e56c353fbe55ec7f2413d9b3264a7d71f6ff8acb73c3267209cc1b
#. default-sha256: 2b903457e3c3bc836572fd935bcc966677872a23ce61c1d95e62775355934baf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3B0F9553_40AB_4C08_9C9A_29FEF480ED2C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s awful.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫There’s no one as pure and as beautiful as you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫이주 고약하지.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마님처럼 아름답고 ⟪k:4⟫일편단심인 사람이 또 어딨다고."

#: scenario3:scenario3_31FA80D5_12A8_4254_B2D4_55D8CD3D7FC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08b65a3a5f1086f9eb594d577edb5ba36e66edf0400a140603e1fd2f07ad85df
#. default-sha256: f3c05c12f0221a977f9b0820607b75961647b106104916615b1531637b21a888
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_31FA80D5_12A8_4254_B2D4_55D8CD3D7FC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫He says... ⟪k:2⟫I am a witch?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫제가…… 마녀……⟪k:2⟫인가요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2938A9B9_A728_4CA9_8E74_A87E86F07571
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45834b8aa1c7b57555392ee88e37adc0eb48ab1a652395b674bfc53f4ada456f
#. default-sha256: ec4bb14e55165225b0ed96e1844889ceda7b2d8b4b6690a48c79414fa78cceab
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2938A9B9_A728_4CA9_8E74_A87E86F07571"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Listen to me, Madam.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He never for a second ⟪k:4⟫actually⟪k:5⟫ loved you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫마님――, ⟪k:2⟫그 녀석은 처음부터 ⟪k:3⟫마님을 사랑하지도 않은 거야."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7E310359_F5BE_44B4_AE3C_7F377E807B21
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 637228ca4313d1afbbbc1c3be943579eb87608f7260403b0a44024e99b0f925e
#. default-sha256: 765dc32e628bb58f80bcc209470cac7437a9829410b45394cc05440892530a23
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7E310359_F5BE_44B4_AE3C_7F377E807B21"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He just wanted the influence attached to your name.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Wanted to mingle with the upper "
"class."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫명가란 권력이 필요해서―― 그게 다고,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫사교계에 가고 싶어서, ⟪k:3⟫그게 다야."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5997B74F_8DC7_4A29_B3D7_CE1F29A03E03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74e44080065da4a4c118089578df90dbb3806337fe0b64cd35e13e6e7e7b5235
#. default-sha256: c0d0ec309a4b5bee7ddf2526be2430c0083b30c511e5a20e2404d19166b5a0ba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5997B74F_8DC7_4A29_B3D7_CE1F29A03E03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He ⟪k:1⟫used⟪k:2⟫ you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫마님을 이용한 거지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4FE46BE7_958C_4C8C_B141_10A50D9C9847
